        <description>
## This package is deprecated.

The package id `refinitive-workspace` had a typo in the brand name (the vendor is **Refinitiv**, not "Refinitive"). It has been renamed to [`refinitiv-workspace`](https://community.chocolatey.org/packages/refinitiv-workspace).

### What you need to do

* Existing installs: this package depends on `refinitiv-workspace` — `choco upgrade refinitive-workspace` will pull in the new id automatically.
* New installs: please use [`refinitiv-workspace`](https://community.chocolatey.org/packages/refinitiv-workspace) directly.

No further versions of `refinitive-workspace` will be published. All future Refinitiv Workspace updates ship under the corrected id.
        </description>
        <summary>[DEPRECATED] Renamed to refinitiv-workspace (typo fix).</summary>
        <dependencies>
            <dependency id="refinitiv-workspace" version="1.26.602" />
        </dependencies>
